#1 Problem Statement
Create a Java program to model a Library Management System using aggregation.
The relationships are:
•	A Library has many Book objects.
•	A Book has one Author (but the author exists independently of the book).
•	If the Library is deleted, the Books still exist → aggregation (not composition).
Requirements
1.	Class: Author
o	Attributes: authorName, email, gender
o	Method: displayAuthorInfo()
2.	Class: Book
o	Attributes: title, isbn, price
o	Relationship: aggregates an Author object
o	Method: displayBookInfo()
3.	Class: Library
o	Contains a collection (e.g., ArrayList<Book>)
o	Methods: addBook(Book b), removeBook(String isbn), displayAllBooks()
4.	Demonstrate aggregation
o	Library aggregates Books.
o	Books aggregate Author.
